<title>USA: North County Bancorp sets 2-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>North County Bancorp sets 2-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>ESCONDIDO, Calif. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>North County Bancorp Thursday set a two-for-one split of the company's common stock, payable April 15.</p>
<p>Based upon the shares outstanding the stock split will increase the number of shares outstanding to approximately 4,006,000 shares.</p>
</text>
